OL,3,GNEWSACommunity champions honoured at
OL,4,ABBC awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom a scout leader supporting
OL,7,Frefugees, to brothers who baked cakes
OL,8,Fto fund volunteering in Kenya, some of
OL,9,FShropshire's most dedicated community
OL,10,Fchampions have been recognised at the
OL,11,FBBC Make a Difference Awards.
OL,13,FDozens of volunteers, fundraisers and
OL,14,Fcommunity groups were honoured at a
OL,15,Fceremony at The Anstice in Madeley,
OL,16,FTelford, on Friday, celebrating people
OL,17,Fwhose efforts have made a lasting
OL,18,Fdifference to communities across the
OL,19,Fcounty.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
