OL,3,GNEWSACommunity champions honoured at
OL,4,ABBC awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FWinners in eight categories were
OL,7,Fannounced following a public nomination
OL,8,Fprocess and consideration by a panel of
OL,9,Findependent and BBC judges.
OL,11,FRose Aston, executive producer at BBC
OL,12,FRadio Shropshire, said it had been "a
OL,13,Fwonderful afternoon celebrating the
OL,14,Fpeople who make our county a better
OL,15,Fplace".
